  "description": "Tracer Tracker DS7 26\" 7 Speed Electric Cruiser Bike\nThe Tracer Tracker DS7 26\" Cruiser E-Bike is the perfect blend of classic style and modern power. Featuring a durable oversized Hi-Ten steel frame and a high-speed 800W brushless motor, this beach cruiser offers a smooth and effortless ride. Equipped with a Shimano TY300 7-speed rear derailleur, disc brakes, and comfortable leather saddle with springs, it’s built for both comfort and performance. The 48V Panasonic lithium-ion battery provides a range of up to 25 miles, making it ideal for leisurely rides or everyday commuting. With wide 26\" x 3.0 white-wall tires, this e-bike ensures stability and style wherever you go.\n\nSADDLE\n\nClassical Cattlehide leather with springs\n\nREAR HUB MOTOR\n48V,800W high speed brushless max speed at 25mil\n\nEXTRAS\nTracer 26\" Tracker Beach Cruiser E-Bike Shimano 1-Speed Steel Frame Disc Brake Hi Rise Handlebars Alloy Black 3\"Rims 26x4.0 Black Tires Motor 800W Panasonic Lithium-ion Battery 48V/17.5 Ah Li-ion",
